，再开连锁餐厅\n00:36:32 内外双循环：bug 报告进的是 Slack/Linear/X，Grok Bot 自动收进来喂给内循环，人从搬运工位置撤下\n00:40:10 大解锁：从「agent 能自己合并代码吗」这个问题倒推整个体系\n00:42:00 幕僚体系：Grok Bot 盯外部、Cursor Projects 云端协调者管内部，三十个 issue 突然涌进来自动拆解分派\n00:46:37 园艺活：2,500 个 PR 大半不是新功能；新人在好环境里第一天就能产出\n00:48:19 例程：找 React 坏模式的 agent 只记账不修——缓冲区逼你看见「这三十个其实是同一个问题」\n00:50:23 review：你尝了 2,500 道菜里的几道——抽样代替阻塞，像工厂质检员；纠错纠环境不纠单个 agent\n00:52:56 黑暗工厂：agent 七乘二十四小时干活、她睡觉时自己合并 PR；full autopilot 每个 PR 配十个 verifier 反复 fuzz；第一次按下开关有多吓人\n00:57:11 反方提问：医疗法律金融这种「单向门」领域怎么办——领域可验证性决定一切；Bend 语言与证明；软件工程恰好好验证\n01:00:41 收尾主题：pstack 与 Matt 的 skills 互补不互斥，过往会话是上下文宝库，recall skill 的来历\n01:06:17 道别：约定 Part 2，周一碰时间","members":[],"jump_url":{},"max_line":2},"replies":null,"assist":0,"up_action":{"like":false,"reply":false},"invisible":false,"reply_control":{"following":true,"max_line":2,"time_desc":"3天前发布","location":"IP属地：山东","translation_switch":1,"support_share":true},"folder":{"has_folded":false,"is_folded":false,"rule":""},"dynamic_id_str":"0","note_cvid_str":"0","track_info":""}],"assist":0,"up_action":{"like":false,"reply":true},"invisible":false,"reply_control":{"action":1,"up_reply":true,"following":true,"is_up_top":true,"max_line":6,"sub_reply_entry_text":"共1条回复","sub_reply_title_text":"相关回复共1条","time_desc":"3天前发布","biz_scene":"opus_1254948169293234214","location":"IP属地：山东","is_note_v2":true,"translation_switch":1,"support_share":true},"folder":{"has_folded":false,"is_folded":false,"rule":""},"dynamic_id":1254948169293234200,"dynamic_id_str":"1254948169293234214","note_cvid_str":"0","track_info":""},"vote":null},"top_replies":[{"rpid":319480644736,"oid":117376775358202,"type":1,"mid":588699709,"root":0,"parent":0,"dialog":0,"count":1,"rcount":1,"state":0,"fansgrade":0,"attr":134218242,"ctime":1791028790,"mid_str":"588699709","oid_str":"117376775358202","rpid_str":"319480644736","root_str":"0","parent_str":"0","dialog_str":"0","like":3,"action":1,"member":{"mid":"588699709","uname":"ChHsich","handle":"","sex":"保密","sign":"so, I use Arch btw.  Git