 米其林厨房，为什么她拒绝「工厂」这个词\n00:14:15 厨房思想实验：全家挤进厨房你会疯——从单打独斗到带副厨，分工怎么让整体大于部分之和\n00:16:22 环境轴：skills、codebase 就是新食材；「agent 已经够强我改不动」是错觉，环境是你能改的部分\n00:17:14 验证：最重要的 skill——给 agent 手和眼，自己跑应用、抓 trace；她进 Cursor 写的第一个 skill 就是它\n00:18:44 循环：没有验证就没有 loop；验证加评分标准=爬山法，Karpathy 的 autoresearch 同思路\n00:20:34 CLI 深挖：把确定性部分写死成脚本省掉判断；没有 CLI 时每个 agent 都在重新发明世界","members":[],"jump_url":{"BV1NFbf6JEj9":{"title":"Matt Pocock 直播：对话《代码整洁之道》作者，AI 时代 软件基本功还重要吗【中英字幕】","state":0,"prefix_icon":"https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/activity-plat/static/20201110/4c8b2dbaded282e67c9a31daa4297c3c/AeQJlYP7e.png","app_url_schema":"","app_name":"","app_package_name":"","click_report":"117125268180347","is_half_screen":false,"exposure_report":"","underline":false,"match_once":false,"pc_url":"","icon_position":0},"BV1WKaV6bEBB":{"title":"React 核心成员分享：在 SpaceXAI 一个月发 2000 个 PR 的 Agent 工作法","state":0,"prefix_icon":"https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/activity-plat/static/20201110/4c8b2dbaded282e67c9a31daa4297c3c/AeQJlYP7e.png","app_url_schema":"","app_name":"","app_package_name":"","click_report":"117348774316856","is_half_screen":false,"exposure_report":"","underline":false,"match_once":false,"pc_url":"","icon_position":0}},"max_line":6,"pictures":[{"img_src":"http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/d9e86d2e323c6b76470e5071905ea627588699709.png","img_width":1791,"img_height":985,"img_size":257.13}],"picture_scale":1},"replies":[{"rpid":319480580544,"oid":117376775358202,"type":1,"mid":588699709,"root":319480644736,"parent":319480644736,"dialog":319480580544,"count":0,"rcount":0,"state":0,"fansgrade":0,"attr":0,"ctime":1791028803,"mid_str":"588699709","oid_str":"117376775358202","rpid_str":"319480580544","root_str":"319480644736","parent_str":"319480644736","dialog_str":"319480580544","like":3,"action":0,"member":{"mid":"588699709","uname":"ChHsich","handle":"","sex":"保密","sign":"so, I use Arch btw.  GitHub@ChHsiching","avatar":"https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/face/aae36910a830559760bb840b8f1bf5bd277c4b65.jpg","rank":"10000","face_nft_new":0,"is